{"id":"f626099313d4c0b8","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md","title":"基础去引号等一致而全自指模式不一致","display":"thm-T-schema-consistency — 基础去引号等一致而全自指模式不一致","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-T-schema-consistency","aliases":["91-thm-T-schema-consistency"],"display":"thm-T-schema-consistency — 基础去引号等一致而全自指模式不一致","depends_on":["[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]","[[91-lem-T-schema-limits]]","[[91-df-T-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-T-schema-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-T-schema-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-T-schema-consistency — 基础去引号等一致而全自指模式不一致"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" href=\"?note=7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" title=\"91-thm-typed-conservative\">91-thm-typed-conservative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5f78118711a12b83\" href=\"?note=5f78118711a12b83\" title=\"91-lem-T-schema-limits\">91-lem-T-schema-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" href=\"?note=7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" title=\"91-thm-typed-conservative\">91-thm-typed-conservative</a> 使用的原书全归纳版本。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 为固定算术矛盾句，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq S\\nvdash\\bot\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq S\\nvdash\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_T}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_T}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\\)</span> 是此处局部定义的全自指实例集；\n它的域有别于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a> 的基础语言实例集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FullT}(\\mathrm{PA},T)=\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_T}(T))\">\\(\\operatorname{FullT}(\\mathrm{PA},T)=\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_T}(T))\\)</span>，采用自然编码及经典对角化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{TB})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{PA}),\n\\qquad\\neg\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\operatorname{FullT}(\\mathrm{PA},T)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{TB})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{PA}),\n\\qquad\\neg\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\operatorname{FullT}(\\mathrm{PA},T)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>TB 包含 PA，故左边一致推出右边；保守性将 TB 对算术矛盾的证明变为 PA 证明，故右边一致推出左边。无需假定每个 PA 模型都有全归纳 TB 的直接扩张。\n全模式包含其说谎者的双条件，与 PA 可证对角式合成即得经典矛盾。把全模式限制到基础语言是理论公理域的限制，而不是使自应用表达式不合式。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.5；§6、Lemma 14.3 的说谎者推理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-typed-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-lem-T-schema-limits","status":"resolved","id":"5f78118711a12b83","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-lem-T-schema-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-typed-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TB}$ 是 [[91-thm-typed-conservative]] 使用的原书全归纳版本。\n$\\bot$ 为固定算术矛盾句，\n$\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq S\\nvdash\\bot$。","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_T}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}$ 是此处局部定义的全自指实例集；\n它的域有别于 [[91-df-T-schema]] 的基础语言实例集。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq S\\nvdash\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_T}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FullT}(\\mathrm{PA},T)=\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_T}(T))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{TB})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{PA}),\n\\qquad\\neg\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\operatorname{FullT}(\\mathrm{PA},T)).","display":true}],"bytes":1865,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[